WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.444 line:91%
Chapter 3. For students. How to join a quiz, and how to answer on your phone.

00:00:06.865 --> 00:00:12.863 line:91%
Open the address that your teacher shows, or scan the QR code. You do not need an app.

00:00:14.031 --> 00:00:23.383 line:91%
Find your name in the list. Your name is not there? Tap "I'm not on the list", write your first name and last name, and wait for your teacher's OK.

00:00:23.845 --> 00:00:27.905 line:91%
Tap your name. Check it is you, and tap "Yes, that's me".

00:00:28.356 --> 00:00:36.684 line:91%
You're in! You get an animal. It appears next to your name on your teacher's screen. Tap "Change my animal" to choose another one.

00:00:37.152 --> 00:00:43.424 line:91%
You can also use your own photo. Your teacher checks it first, and you get 3 bonus points!

00:00:43.878 --> 00:00:46.244 line:91%
Now you wait for your teacher.

00:00:46.707 --> 00:00:52.903 line:91%
No phone? Your friend taps "My friend has no phone", and chooses your name. You answer together.

00:00:53.362 --> 00:00:56.823 line:91%
The test starts! Read the question on your phone.

00:00:57.283 --> 00:01:04.563 line:91%
Multiple choice: tap one answer, then tap "Submit answer". Be quick! Fast answers get more points.

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:11.065 line:91%
When your teacher shows the answer, your phone says if you were right, and how many points you got.

00:01:11.521 --> 00:01:15.365 line:91%
True or false: tap True or False, then Submit.

00:01:17.073 --> 00:01:20.365 line:91%
Gap fill: type the missing word, then Submit.

00:01:22.412 --> 00:01:27.145 line:91%
Matching: tap a word, then tap its meaning. Do this for every word.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.524 line:91%
Then tap Submit.

00:01:31.755 --> 00:01:37.524 line:91%
Put the words in order: tap the words one by one. Made a mistake? Tap "Start again".

00:01:37.981 --> 00:01:39.785 line:91%
Then Submit.

00:01:41.168 --> 00:01:48.164 line:91%
Do not leave the quiz page during a question! If you leave for 3 seconds, your answer counts as wrong.

00:01:48.614 --> 00:01:52.265 line:91%
At the end, the podium shows the top three students.

00:01:58.342 --> 00:02:02.205 line:91%
Then your phone shows your place and your score. Well done!

00:02:02.669 --> 00:02:11.924 line:91%
Next time, your phone remembers you, and joins by itself. Only your phone can use your name. Not your name? Tap "This is not my name".

00:02:12.387 --> 00:02:22.484 line:91%
The menu button at the top right opens your things: your words, your writing, your skills, your certificates, and reading help. Chapter 16 shows them.

00:02:22.944 --> 00:02:29.043 line:91%
When your teacher gives you homework, a "My homework" button also shows the number of things to do.
